  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DEC Ukraine Humanitarian Appeal Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency cash assistance and other services to the most vulnerable people displaced by the conflict in Ukraine, in both Ukraine and Poland. This entry refers to Phase 2a (12 months 1st September 2022 &#x2013; 31 August 2023) and Phase 2b (18 months: 1st September 2023 &#x2013; 31st Aug 2025).</narrative>
  </description>
